### Page 127
Box Shadow
• Definition: Adds shadow effects around the element’s
box /text(outside the border).
• box-shadow: offset-x offset-y blur-radius color;
div {
box-shadow: inset 0px 0px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
}
h1 {
text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px black;
}
